00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:16.209 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:17.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That we need to
start talking about

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:19.112 line:92%
