-I don't know.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think I -- We'll just se
what happens.

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:45.972 line:92%
-Yeah, we'll see what happens.

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:48.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don't want to say Wednesda
and then all of a sudden,

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:49.209 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
you're a Thursday.

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:50.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
And then it's already a loss

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:51.411 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, exactly.

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:52.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I just know I'm ahead of
18 people right now.

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:54.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's pretty good.
-You're ahead of 18 people

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:56.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's right.
-That's really exciting.

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:58.485 size:84% position:42%
-Yeah, glass half full.
-Yeah, glass half full.

