this evidence,

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:20.073 line:92%
what is your take on it so far

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:23.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I think that
there could be impeachment

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:25.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
