00:03:23.336 --> 00:03:27.207 size:84% position:42%
-The other thing is --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:28.875 line:92%
There's a lot of distractions.

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:30.143 line:92%
