00:04:21.794 --> 00:04:23.796 line:92%
-Okay, then. There you go.

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:24.664 line:92%
Okay, so why is it important

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:27.667
Well, first of all, you hear
